// getMappedReads, getUnmappedReads and coveragePlot take their image from
// configs/containers.config, which picks an ILLUMINA-only SIF unless the mode is
// NANOPORE, and this fixture runs in the default mode. CI runs the suite under
// -profile docker and only builds the nanopore base image, so point them at
// params.base_container instead: it resolves to the local SIF under the
// singularity profile and to the Docker tag under the docker profile, and it
// carries samtools and bamdash either way. A closure, like the NP_basecontainer
// label, so it resolves per task once the parameters are final, and read through
// getOrDefault for the same reason as that label: see nextflow.config.
process {
    withName: 'getMappedReads|getUnmappedReads|coveragePlot' {
        container = { params.getOrDefault('base_container', null) }
    }
}
